  "story": {
    "title": "The Crab and the Crib",
    "bgm": "bgm_silly",
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u07_1",
        "desc": "Afternoon. A low wall of red bricks crosses the forest path; in the middle of the wall is a small round door made of bricks with the two letters b and r carved on it — the ONLY text allowed in the picture. On top of the wall sits a small red crab with a toy drum hanging around its neck, snapping its big claws at anyone who comes near. Bun jumps back; Hedgie hides behind her; Pip says the two letters in the wrong order; Pim and Pam hover side by side. A pink dress hangs on a washing line between two trees. Hidden in the picture: the bricks, the crab, the drum, the pink dress.",
        "hidden": [
          "brick",
          "crab",
          "drum",
          "dress"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "A crab with a drum!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l1",
            "ko": "북을 멘 게야!"
          },
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Snip! Snip! Snip!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l2",
            "ko": "싹둑! 싹둑! 싹둑!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Rb? Rb? Rbick?",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l3",
            "ko": "르브? 르브? 르빅?"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u07_1",
        "ko": "빨간 벽돌담이 길을 막았어요. 담 위에서 북을 멘 게가 집게를 싹둑싹둑! 핍은 br 을 거꾸로 \"르브?\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What is on the wall?",
            "ko": "담 위에 뭐가 있어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does the crab have?",
            "ko": "게가 뭘 메고 있어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u07_2",
        "desc": "Pim and Pam say the two sounds together and the bricks of the little door hop apart one by one and stack themselves neatly beside the path, opening a gap in the wall. The crab, startled, plays a quick drumroll. Beads holds up three beads. Through the gap, under a leafy tree, stands a small wooden baby crib with a soft blue blanket, and in it lies a big white egg. Hidden in the picture: the bricks, the drum, the crib.",
        "hidden": [
          "brick",
          "drum",
          "crib",
          "crab"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "twins",
            "text": "Together! /br/ /br/ brick!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l4",
            "pop": "br",
            "ko": "함께! /br/ /br/ 벽돌!"
          },
          {
            "who": "beads",
            "text": "/br/ /ɪ/ /k/ brick!",
            "audio": "blend_brick__beads",
            "pop": "brick",
            "ko": "/br/ /ɪ/ /k/ 벽돌!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "Look! A crib with an egg!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l5",
            "ko": "봐! 알이 든 아기 침대!"
          }
        ],
        "video": "vid_b3_u07_2",
        "ko": "핌과 팜이 /br/! 벽돌들이 폴짝폴짝 비켜 문이 열려요. 담 너머 나무 아래, 아기 침대에 커다란 알이 있어요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What is in the crib?",
            "ko": "아기 침대에 뭐가 있어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What do the bricks do?",
            "ko": "벽돌들은 어떻게 됐어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u07_3",
        "desc": "The friends gather around the crib. A zigzag crack runs across the white egg and a tiny yellow beak pokes out; the crab, now gentle, sweeps bits of shell away with a little brush; Pip leans in with its beak open; Hedgie holds his paws together; Bun kneels. Hidden in the picture: the crack in the egg, the crib, the brush, the crab.",
        "hidden": [
          "crack",
          "crib",
          "brush",
          "crab"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Crack! Crack! Crack!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l6",
            "ko": "쩍! 쩍! 쩍!"
          },
          {
            "who": "pip",
            "text": "Rc? No! Cr... crack!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l7",
            "ko": "르크? 아니! 크르… 크랙!"
          },
          {
            "who": "bun",
            "text": "A little chick! Shh...",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l8",
            "ko": "아기 새야! 쉿…"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "알에 쩍 금이 가고 작은 노란 부리가 쏙! 게가 솔로 껍데기를 쓸어 줘요. 핍이 두 번째에 \"크랙!\"",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "What comes out of the egg?",
            "ko": "알에서 뭐가 나와?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does the crab hold?",
            "ko": "게는 뭘 들고 있어?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "scene_b3_u07_4",
        "desc": "A fluffy little grey baby bird has hatched and sits in the crib under the blue blanket, yawning. The crab lifts its claws to bang its drum in celebration — but Grumble has climbed down the tree and gently puts his paw on the drum, then hangs his glowing lantern on a branch over the crib like a soft night-light. Everyone smiles. Hidden in the picture: the drum, the crib, the pink dress on the washing line, the brush.",
        "hidden": [
          "drum",
          "crib",
          "dress",
          "brush"
        ],
        "lines": [
          {
            "who": "narrator",
            "text": "Drum, drum, drum!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l9",
            "ko": "둥, 둥, 둥!"
          },
          {
            "who": "grumble",
            "text": "Shh! Not the drum!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l10",
            "ko": "쉿! 북은 안 돼!"
          },
          {
            "who": "hedgie",
            "text": "A lantern for the crib!",
            "audio": "b3_u07_l11",
            "ko": "아기 침대에 등불을!"
          }
        ],
        "ko": "아기 새가 태어났어요! 게가 북을 치려 하자 내려온 그럼블이 \"쉿! 북은 안 돼!\" 그리고 등불을 아기 침대 위에 걸어 줘요.",
        "ask": [
          {
            "en": "Who hatched?",
            "ko": "누가 태어났어?"
          },
          {
            "en": "What does Grumble hang up?",
            "ko": "그럼블은 뭘 걸어 줬어?"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "synopsis_ko": "벽돌담 위에서 북을 멘 게가 집게를 싹둑싹둑. 핌과 팜이 /br/! 벽돌이 비켜나고 아기 침대 속 알에 쩍 금이 가요. 핍은 \"크랙!\"을 두 번째에 바로 말해요. 아기 새가 태어나자 그럼블이 나무에서 내려와 등불을 걸어 줘요.",
    "so_far_ko": "까만 블록을 치우고 멈춘 시계를 고쳤어요. 그럼블이 몰래 손뼉을 쳤어요.",
    "goal_ko": "br·cr·dr 을 말해 벽돌문을 열고 아기 새를 지켜 줘요."
  },
